  "rawHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;background:#ece4d2;padding:4px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #1f2a2a;padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#5e6f6a;\">FIG. CAVE — 04</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Lora',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:13px;color:#1f2a2a;margin-top:2px;\">Notabene · 告示</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#5e6f6a;letter-spacing:.2em;line-height:1;\">\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block;border-left:1px solid #5e6f6a;height:6px;margin-right:3px;vertical-align:bottom;\"></span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block;border-left:1px solid #5e6f6a;height:10px;margin-right:3px;vertical-align:bottom;\"></span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block;border-left:1px solid #5e6f6a;height:6px;margin-right:3px;vertical-align:bottom;\"></span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block;border-left:1px solid #5e6f6a;height:10px;margin-right:3px;vertical-align:bottom;\"></span>\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block;border-left:1px solid #5e6f6a;height:6px;margin-right:3px;vertical-align:bottom;\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.95;color:#1f2a2a;margin:0;\">所有物种学名以《中国植物志》最新版为准，俗名沿用调查地方言，<span style=\"color:#5e6f6a;\">不强行统一。</span></p>\n</div>"
